# Crash reporting (GlitchTip).
#
# This DSN is PUBLIC by design and is committed deliberately. A Sentry-protocol
# DSN identifies a project for SENDING events; it grants no read access, cannot
# query anything, and is visible in the shipped bundle of every app that uses
# one. Keeping it in a secret would buy nothing and would mean local builds and
# contributors' builds silently ship with error reporting disabled.
#
# Vite only exposes `VITE_`-prefixed vars to client code, and only `.env.production`
# is loaded for `vite build`, so development runs with reporting off by default.
VITE_GLITCHTIP_DSN=https://61293578891b4b7dbfb19b0bf2a974c4@app.glitchtip.com/25796
